#: .\simbaapp\templates\home.html:70
msgid ""
" SIMBA is a web and mobile based educational platform that empowers teachers "
"to design, deploy,\n"
"                    and analyze "
msgstr ""

#: .\simbaapp\templates\home.html:71
msgid "pedagogically-grounded"
msgstr ""

#: .\simbaapp\templates\home.html:71
msgid ""
"chatbots powered by large language models.\n"
"                    While generative AI is becoming increasingly available, "
"educators often lack the tools to\n"
"                    transform it into purposeful, trackable, and effective "
"learning experiences.\n"
"                    SIMBA was co-developed with instructors to fill this gap "
"and meet real classroom needs,\n"
"                    aligning LLMs with structured teaching practices that "
"support students development of critical\n"
"                    thinking and self-reflection through guided dialogue and "
"actionable insights.\n"
"\n"
"                    No coding required — just thoughtful pedagogy translated "
"into interactive dialogues.\n"
"                    "
msgstr ""

